BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ummi-20260707@ummi.local
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260707
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260708
SUMMARY:Nuts
DESCRIPTION:Good fats\, protein and vitamin E. Nuts are safe in pregnancy u
 nless you are allergic or have been told to avoid them (NHS).\n\nAlso toda
 y:\n• Rub Khāke Shifāʾ on your stomach (From the start of the fifth m
 onth. Turbah from Karbalāʾ. From Marriage to Parenthood\, p.113.)\n• A
 dhān and iqāmah at ṣalāh time (With your hand on your stomach. From M
 arriage to Parenthood\, p.113.)\n• Sūrah an-Naṣr (110) in the daily p
 rayers (From Marriage to Parenthood\, p.113.)\n• Sūrah al-Fātiḥah (1
 ) over an egg (Then eat it on an empty stomach. From Marriage to Parenthoo
 d\, p.113.)\n• A date every morning (Dates on an empty stomach are prais
 ed in Makārim al-Akhlāq\, p.169. From Marriage to Parenthood\, p.113.)\n
 \nWeek 17\, month 5 of the guide.
CATEGORIES:Food
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
