BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ummi-20261027@ummi.local
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261027
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261028
SUMMARY:Sūrah al-Insān (76) over dates and milk
DESCRIPTION:Then take them on an empty stomach. From Marriage to Parenthood
 \, p.115.\n\nAlso today:\n• Ṣalawāt 140 times (Allāhumma ṣalli ʿa
 lā Muḥammadin wa Āli Muḥammad.)\n• Istighfār 70 times after each 
 prayer (Astaghfirullāha Rabbī wa atūbu ilayh. The Prophet (s) sought fo
 rgiveness seventy times a day (al-Kāfī\, Vol. 2\, p.505).)\n• Sūrah a
 l-ʿAṣr (103) and adh-Dhāriyāt (51) (In the Ẓuhr and ʿAṣr prayers
 \, one in each of the first two rakʿahs. adh-Dhāriyāt is long\, so leav
 e it out if time is short (Sistani\, ruling 965). From Marriage to Parenth
 ood\, p.115.)\n• Dates and kebabs (“Feed women dates in the month they
  give birth\, and their child will be forbearing and pure.” The Prophet 
 (s)\, in Makārim al-Akhlāq\, p.169. Kebabs: From Marriage to Parenthood\
 , p.115.)\n• A daily walk (Any amount helps\; the NHS says 30 minutes a 
 day can be enough.)\n\nWeek 33\, month 9 of the guide.
CATEGORIES:Sūrah
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ummi-20261028@ummi.local
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261028
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261029
SUMMARY:Dates and kebabs
DESCRIPTION:“Feed women dates in the month they give birth\, and their ch
 ild will be forbearing and pure.” The Prophet (s)\, in Makārim al-Akhl
 āq\, p.169. Kebabs: From Marriage to Parenthood\, p.115.\n\nAlso today:\n
 • Ṣalawāt 140 times (Allāhumma ṣalli ʿalā Muḥammadin wa Āli M
 uḥammad.)\n• Istighfār 70 times after each prayer (Astaghfirullāha R
 abbī wa atūbu ilayh. The Prophet (s) sought forgiveness seventy times a 
 day (al-Kāfī\, Vol. 2\, p.505).)\n• Sūrah al-ʿAṣr (103) and adh-Dh
 āriyāt (51) (In the Ẓuhr and ʿAṣr prayers\, one in each of the firs
 t two rakʿahs. adh-Dhāriyāt is long\, so leave it out if time is short 
 (Sistani\, ruling 965). From Marriage to Parenthood\, p.115.)\n• Sūrah 
 al-Insān (76) over dates and milk (Then take them on an empty stomach. Fr
 om Marriage to Parenthood\, p.115.)\n• A daily walk (Any amount helps\; 
 the NHS says 30 minutes a day can be enough.)\n\nWeek 33\, month 9 of the 
 guide.
CATEGORIES:Food
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
