 Ẓuhr and ʿAṣr prayers\, one in each of the first two rakʿahs. adh-Dh
 āriyāt is long\, so leave it out if time is short (Sistani\, ruling 965)
 . From Marriage to Parenthood\, p.115.)\n• Sūrah al-Ḥajj (22) (From M
 arriage to Parenthood\, p.115.)\n• Sūrah al-Insān (76) over dates and 
