 115.)\n• Dates and kebabs (“Feed women dates in the month they give bi
 rth\, and their child will be forbearing and pure.” The Prophet (s)\, in
  Makārim al-Akhlāq\, p.169. Kebabs: From Marriage to Parenthood\, p.115.
 )\n• A daily walk (Any amount helps\; the NHS says 30 minutes a day can 
 be enough.)\n\nWeek 33\, month 9 of the guide.
CATEGORIES:Sūrah
